{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44027","headline":"宛转歌二首 一 · 郎大家宋氏","name":"宛转歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风已清，月朗琴复鸣。\n掩抑非千态，殷勤是一声。\n歌宛转，宛转和且长。\n愿爲双鸿鹄，比翼共翺翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎大家宋氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}